OL,13,     FMitsubishi Evo 4: Tim and Fuzz
OL,14,     Fhead to Devon to fix up a 1997
OL,15,     FMitsubishi Evo 4: the high-tech
OL,16,     Ffour-wheel-drive car that
OL,17,     Fdominated rallies and could hold
OL,18,     Fits own with supercars.
