OL,11,G1955 Grand Designs
OL,12,     FJoe and Lina are fed up with
OL,13,     Frenting but can't afford to buy.
OL,14,     FSo they're building their own
OL,15,     Fclever, space-saving two-bedroom
OL,16,     Fhome for #160,000, on a tiny plot
OL,17,     Fin east London.
